creatures:
- name: Frost Giant
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 149 (rollable(dice=13d12 + 65,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Initiative) (12)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=23)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=21)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Athletics rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Athletics Check), Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** cold  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 13  
      **Languages** Giant  
      **Challenge** 8 (3,900 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The giant makes two attacks, using Frost Axe or Great Bow in any combination.

      ***Frost Axe.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=To Hit [Frost Axe]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d12+6,dicelabel=Damage [Frost Axe]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d8,dicelabel=Damage [Frost Axe]) Cold damage.

      ***Great Bow.*** *Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=To Hit [Great Bow]), range 150/600 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+6,dicelabel=Damage [Great Bow]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Great Bow]) Cold damage, and the target's ***Speed*** decreases by 10 feet until the end of its next turn.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***War Cry (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [War Cry])).*** The giant or one creature of its choice that can see or hear it gains 16 (rollable(dice=2d10 + 5,dicelabel=War Cry)) ***Temporary Hit Points*** and has ***Advantage*** on attack rolls until the start of the giant's next turn.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Huge Giant, Neutral Evil*  
    **Challenge** 8
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024frostgiant
  status: 1

